Package: inkr
Title: CSS-Like Styling Language for Terminal User Interfaces
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "TODO-GIVEN-NAME", family = "TODO-FAMILY-NAME",
           email = "todo-maintainer@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Ink for R is a CSS-like styling language and engine for
    terminal user interfaces. This early version parses stylesheets written
    in the 'inkr' language (files with the '.inkr' extension) into an
    abstract syntax tree, reporting malformed input with structured syntax
    errors. It has no dependency on any particular terminal user interface
    framework.
